---
/**
 * Site-wide "under construction" strip, directly under the header.
 * Deliberately not filled yellow — that is the schedule banner's job, and two
 * loud strips stacked would fight each other.
 */
---
<div class="notice">
  <p class="container inner">
    <span class="tag">Ve výstavbě</span>
    <span>Web se teprve staví — postupně přibudou klipy, videa a návody.</span>
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .notice {
    background: var(--card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-edge);
  }
  .inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin: 0;
    padding-block: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .tag {
    flex: none;
    padding: 0.12rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg-top);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
